# LoopSight — environment template (copy to .env and fill as needed)
# Deployment target: AWS Lambda on ARM64 (always-free tier), NOT a Graviton EC2 instance.
# Best Use of COOL is NOT pursued — COOL requires paid Marketplace AMI + m8g.4xlarge (not free).
# Overall Awards + Agentic Vision are the target; Lambda's always-free tier (1M req + 400k GB-s) covers demo volumes.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY is optional: when set, the inference service calls Gemini for tool selection;
# when empty/unset, it uses a deterministic mock fixture so local dev works without a key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# DynamoDB table for job persistence (optional): when AWS credentials + DYNAMO_TABLE_NAME are set,
# jobs are stored in DynamoDB; otherwise the in-memory store is used and no AWS account is required.
# DYNAMO_TABLE_NAME=loopsight-jobs
# Inference URL for the Next.js frontend:
#  - Local dev default is http://localhost:8000
#  - After Lambda deploy, set to your API Gateway HTTP API URL, e.g. https://<api-id>.execute-api.<region>.amazonaws.com
# INFERENCE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Lambda deploy (see services/inference/README_DEPLOY_LAMBDA.md):
#  - ECR repo and image are built for linux/arm64 and pushed; Lambda runs on arm64, 1024 MB, 30 s timeout — all inside free tier at demo scale.
#  - Set a CloudWatch billing alarm at $1 as a tripwire even on free tier.
